It's the energy that we, the gods, need in order to act.

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:06.660
Our AP is used up the entire time we're in action.

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:11.000
When we attack or receive damage
and exhaust our AP,

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:13.790
