00:04:44.790 --> 00:04:47.580
And Kururi-chan... has her own issues.

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:49.200
Sorry!

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:51.830
Kururi-san... has her own issues?!

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:56.410
Takuma-chan can currently
make up to two people transform.

00:04:56.620 --> 00:04:58.160
