00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:29.750
Um... I always feel an extraordinarily
intimidating air from her,

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:34.160
Rumble
Rumble
Ba-dump
Ba-dump

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:33.080
so I want to start mentally preparing myself
for tomorrow right now.

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:34.160
Oh.

