He comes to speak to me
more often than he used to...

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:43.700
I suspect that Yakumo may be bothered by
the sound of your heart beating.

00:06:43.700 --> 00:06:44.700
Huh?

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:48.080
Yakumo has had very sensitive hearing
since she was born.

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:53.750
Seidr. It's an idiosyncrasy
that a demigod is rarely born with.

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:59.290
In Yakumo's case, that means she catches
everything, no matter how small the sound.

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:03.500
It's at the level where if she doesn't wear her
headphones to block out the sounds around her,

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:06.290
it would interfere with her daily life.

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:08.830
Give them back...

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:14.290
Now that you mention it, she really hated it
when I got her headphones during Tag.

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:18.660
I-is the sound of my heart that noisy to her?

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:22.620
Well, even with my ears I can hear it faintly.

00:07:23.620 --> 00:07:28.250
Anyways, don't get too frightened
if you want to avoid upsetting Yakumo.

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:33.450
Though, he is mustering up the courage to go for
that date, and that's a good mindset to have!

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:36.700
You can do this, Takuma!

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:43.700
At any rate, I have to make sure
my heart doesn't beat too hard!

00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:47.040
