00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:17.410
But I have to keep going!

00:12:23.120 --> 00:12:25.790
MOLE
Fine Confections
Sweet Buns

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:25.790
This is a gift for Mutsumi-chan.

00:12:25.790 --> 00:12:27.700
