00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:11.750
Don't lower your guard.

00:13:13.580 --> 00:13:16.000
It won't even take me 100 seconds
to chop you into pieces!

00:13:17.290 --> 00:13:20.620
No way, we're still in the middle of our date!

00:13:20.620 --> 00:13:23.040
Mutsumi, let's hurry and transform.

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:24.330
O-okay.

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:27.080
What? She chose his lips?!

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:30.120
Er, then where will I...

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:35.620
Big Brother, next time for sure...

00:13:36.200 --> 00:13:38.950
I want you to show me what makes you our lover.

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:41.580
I won't let you down!

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:00.370
Hey, you two.

00:14:00.580 --> 00:14:02.580
