00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:06.330
Akuma Exhaustion Tag Strategy...

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:08.040
Commence!

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:14.750
Here we go, you two!

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:15.950
'Kay.
O-okay!

00:14:23.790 --> 00:14:28.000
"Akuma Exhaustion Tag Strategy..." what's that?

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:33.910
Just like we said earlier,
the gods need AP in order to act.

00:14:33.910 --> 00:14:36.620
But it's the same thing for the akuma.

00:14:36.620 --> 00:14:40.250
They get summoned,
and their AP decreases just by being here.

00:14:40.580 --> 00:14:44.450
"Damage Taken... 1 AP Consumed"

00:14:40.580 --> 00:14:44.450
And when the AP reaches zero, the akuma vanishes.

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:47.450
"Summoned... 10 AP Consumed"

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:50.540
So Mutsumi's "Evade the akuma on wings
and make it consume it's AP" is named...

00:14:47.450 --> 00:14:50.540
"Attack... 10 AP Consumed"

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:54.080
the "Akuma Exhaustion Tag Strategy"!

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:00.620
Did the akuma disappear?

00:15:04.580 --> 00:15:05.450
Darn...

00:15:09.290 --> 00:15:10.250
A song?

00:15:10.500 --> 00:15:11.750
