00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:18.250
Thanks, Yakumo-chan!

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:20.660
We should get out of here while we still can.

00:15:20.660 --> 00:15:21.700
Right!

00:15:21.700 --> 00:15:22.750
What was that?

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:23.750
That was scary!

00:15:23.750 --> 00:15:24.700
We've gotta call the cops.

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:27.660
I told you there was nothing to worry about.

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:31.830
Eikthyrnir is a normal attack type akuma,
focused on slash attacks.

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:35.910
Helmwige's wings and
Grimgerde sound will defeat that.

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:38.370
Yeah.

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:41.750
You can do it, Mutsumi, Yakumo... Takuma!

00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:46.410
Yakumo-chan, do you have any energy left?

00:15:46.580 --> 00:15:51.500
I'll be okay for now, but a long battle
may be cutting it close.

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:55.410
Takuma-kun, do you have the tablet
you got from Kururi-chan?

00:15:55.410 --> 00:15:58.540
We can measure the akuma's parameters with it.

00:15:58.700 --> 00:16:01.250
Right. Let me see...

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:09.750
Eikthyrnir
Helmwige
Grimgerde

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:03.500
It hasn't gotten much weaker at all.

00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:04.950
Can't do anything about that.

00:16:04.950 --> 00:16:07.950
Th-the fight has just started!

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:09.620
We're getting serious now!

00:16:09.910 --> 00:16:12.620
Those two are extremely worn out...

00:16:12.620 --> 00:16:15.000
Are their levels still too low after all?

00:16:16.750 --> 00:16:20.410
It has to be because I've failed so many dates!

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:21.660
It just has to!

00:16:27.660 --> 00:16:29.120
So noisy.

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:32.290
I can hear the sound directly
since I don't have my headphones.

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:33.450
Shut up.

00:16:33.450 --> 00:16:35.410
I seriously want to threaten him as soon as...

00:16:36.330 --> 00:16:37.660
Watch out! It's below us!

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:45.580
Attack weakened. Defense strengthened.

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:54.450
Alright. This'll be okay.

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:56.290
As long as we keep evading it,

00:16:56.290 --> 00:17:00.250
and as long the akuma keeps attacking,
our victory draws closer!

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:03.450
I will protect those two!

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:06.660
Huh?

00:17:07.410 --> 00:17:08.500
An arrow?

00:17:19.500 --> 00:17:22.160
I can't believe that akuma self-destructed!

00:17:25.580 --> 00:17:28.080
Mutsumi-san, Yakumo-san!

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:36.330
Takuma-kun! Get out of here!

00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:41.080
A few days earlier

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:41.080
Takuma-chan, do you know what this is?

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:45.700
It's a sprig of mistletoe... Misteltein, was it?

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:47.250
Yes.

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:50.160
The tears of the tree of life, divided into three...

00:17:50.160 --> 00:17:55.580
Of the branches of Yggdrasil Ea, it controls progress
and is the most valuable asset of Asgard.

00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:59.620
Right now, it's power is completely exhausted
and it's lying dormant.

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:02.120
Do you remember, Takuma-chan?

00:18:02.370 --> 00:18:05.500
Do you remember when you almost died
at the campus festival?

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:06.700
Yeah.

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:11.910
It was your ability as Einheijer
that revived you at that time.

00:18:12.370 --> 00:18:16.580
However, you're like a bud
that has still only just blossomed.

00:18:16.580 --> 00:18:22.660
Without the help of Miteltein, we don't know when
your restorative ability will be invoked.

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:27.160
It's true that I haven't been able to
call forth that book at all since then...

00:18:27.450 --> 00:18:31.870
You may not be able to handle everything
next time, Takuma-chan.

00:18:31.870 --> 00:18:34.250
So don't force yourself, alright?

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:35.500
Okay.

00:18:35.500 --> 00:18:38.250
Moreover, I'm extremely sorry about this, but...

00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:39.250
Huh?

00:18:41.040 --> 00:18:45.290
...please take good care of my younger sisters.

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:49.080
The only one who can heal the maidens is Einheijer;

00:18:49.080 --> 00:18:52.290
and that's you as their lover, Takuma-chan.

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:04.500
No!

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:05.450
Get away!

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:09.500
Takuma-kun!

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:17.290
Compared to people...

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:19.910
akuma are a joke!

00:19:27.620 --> 00:19:29.200
Einheijer...

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:31.540
Invoke... the book!

00:19:41.410 --> 00:19:43.830
Holy Sword, Maximum Strength!

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:56.000
This is quite the mess.

00:19:57.750 --> 00:20:01.580
I prefer not to use any more war assets in Midgard,

00:20:01.580 --> 00:20:04.120
where there are restrictions to demon summoning.

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:06.750
That being said, even if I attack,

00:20:06.750 --> 00:20:10.950
I'll just be killed by the first or second one
at level one while seeking my revenge.

00:20:11.450 --> 00:20:14.500
Besides, Einheijer is in the process
of awakening his abilities.

00:20:15.330 --> 00:20:19.250
Though I'm loathe to admit it, I suppose I have
no choice but to summon her after all.

00:20:20.160 --> 00:20:23.790
I'll call the demigoddess, 'Our Lady.'

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:30.660
Tea

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:30.660
Goodness, swinging at that akuma
was way too reckless of you.

00:20:30.950 --> 00:20:32.080
Here's some tea.

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:34.370
Th-thank you.

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:37.410
We got a report from around this area...

00:20:37.410 --> 00:20:39.540
You're clearly imagining things!

00:20:39.540 --> 00:20:42.120
We're just taking Sue-chan for a walk!

00:20:43.120 --> 00:20:46.830
M-Mutsumi-chan! I-if you don't mind,
please accept this gift!

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:49.540
Wow, thanks! Um...

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:52.250
I-I'm Yamada! I'm in the class next door!

00:20:52.750 --> 00:20:55.950
But, well... um, I suppose...

00:20:55.950 --> 00:20:58.290
That was kind of cool, I guess.

00:21:02.370 --> 00:21:05.040
I said "kind of" cool! Only kind of!

00:21:05.040 --> 00:21:06.450
O-okay.

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:16.080
What's wrong, Yakumo?

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:19.080
Nothing.

00:21:19.080 --> 00:21:21.500
Er, u-um, Yakumo-sa...

00:21:22.870 --> 00:21:24.200
I hope you die.

00:21:24.370 --> 00:21:25.370
Stab!

00:21:25.910 --> 00:21:27.580
I-I'm sorry.

00:21:27.580 --> 00:21:28.870
I hope you die.

00:21:28.870 --> 00:21:30.660
Stab! STAB!

00:21:30.660 --> 00:21:35.450
Y-Yakumo! Th-that's enough! Stop it! Stop it!

00:21:36.120 --> 00:21:39.540
Up-date! Date! Date! Please, please!
(Please, please up-date my love)

00:21:39.540 --> 00:21:42.790
Heart! Heart! Heart! Please, please!
(Please, please show your heart)

00:21:42.790 --> 00:21:49.330
Koi o shiranakucha you and I, hajimaranai no yo?

00:21:50.870 --> 00:22:01.830
Nine times out of love on cloud nine

00:22:01.830 --> 00:22:03.830
We wanna share your heart!

00:22:03.830 --> 00:22:07.080
(How do you tell me?)
Amai kotoba o input

00:22:07.080 --> 00:22:10.290
Shippai - Cancel - Zenzen hibikanai wa ne
(Please don't be shy)

00:22:10.290 --> 00:22:13.500
(How to make dream)
Touch shite todokete yo

00:22:13.500 --> 00:22:17.120
Seikou - Complete - Saisentan ga ii yo ne?
(Hold me tight)

00:22:17.910 --> 00:22:22.620
Naze koi to itte kurenai no?

00:22:22.620 --> 00:22:25.660
Ai ni yukou!

00:22:25.660 --> 00:22:32.830
Motto keiken shite level up otome gokoro

00:22:33.950 --> 00:22:37.540
Up-date! Date! Date! Please, please!
(Please, please up-date my love)

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:40.870
Heart! Heart! Heart! Please, please!
(Please, please show your heart)

00:22:40.870 --> 00:22:46.830
Oshiete ageru wa, koi wa otome no power!
(Love gave the power to Valkyrie)

00:22:46.830 --> 00:22:50.370
Jucchuuhakku kitto mou lovers!
(Please, please up-date my love)

00:22:50.370 --> 00:22:53.750
Tokimeku mune dance, dance!
(Please, please show your heart)

00:22:53.750 --> 00:22:56.950
Akuma de shy na mind, kiss for you!

00:22:56.950 --> 00:23:00.160
Kaete shimau yo na, kiss for me!

00:23:00.160 --> 00:23:03.540
Koi o hajimemasho!

00:23:08.330 --> 00:23:11.870
It was a task to deceive that officer
that came here due to the report.

00:23:11.870 --> 00:23:16.790
Sorry, Itsuyo-chan. But you know,
I'm glad we defeated that akuma.

00:23:16.790 --> 00:23:19.040
Even though I'm not suited to battle,

00:23:19.040 --> 00:23:22.580
if I have the help of Yakumo-chan and Takuma-kun,
it seems like things will work out.

00:23:22.580 --> 00:23:25.410
Big Sister Misa's strategy was also quite good.

00:23:25.580 --> 00:23:30.910
Since Natsuki has the highest level of all of us
and she can't fight, we did what we could.

00:23:31.330 --> 00:23:41.080
Next time: The Touching Maiden and the Touched Maiden

00:23:31.330 --> 00:23:34.580
Next time, "The Touching Maiden
and the Touched Maiden."

00:23:34.580 --> 00:23:37.790
I'll use this opportunity to do
all the Val Love that I can with Takuma-san!

00:23:37.790 --> 00:23:40.080
No fair, Itsuyo-chan!
